From lgautier at gmail.com  Wed Jun 25 18:29:50 2008
From: lgautier at gmail.com (Laurent Gautier)
Date: Wed, 25 Jun 2008 20:29:50 +0200
Subject: Re: [Rpy] a few high-level questions about rpy2 and a question about matrix indexing
In-Reply-To: <7237f33d0806250740h4f42d2cdt9b0d263cad3eddb@mail.gmail.com>
